    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scarred by a war that nobody remembers, SECTOR 80 is doomed space. Legends tell of a galaxy-spanning disaster and unfathomable treasure left in its wake. Many expeditions have been sent to SECTOR 80, but none have ever returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not supposed to be here. Something has gone terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the sector, scavenge what you can, and find out what really happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f9ab1476f0884ec4b55cfd40a1d0a7ed.avif?t=1752637767\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/ba5ca11179fc8254cba6a764e9c1096c.poster.avif?t=1752637767\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/ba5ca11179fc8254cba6a764e9c1096c.webm?t=1752637767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/ba5ca11179fc8254cba6a764e9c1096c.mp4?t=1752637767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you find in SECTOR 80 is battered and abandoned. You must work with what you have: there are no fabricators, nano-scale 3D printers, or factories here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every part you find might be key to your next invention. A damaged battery might be a critical power source in a pinch, or perhaps an effective explosive in the right hands!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/ecc4547f1f23e016f910c9437dd2f325.avif?t=1752637767\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f5a90eed29fe0e2d38e78d26e4b4006a.poster.avif?t=1752637767\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f5a90eed29fe0e2d38e78d26e4b4006a.webm?t=1752637767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f5a90eed29fe0e2d38e78d26e4b4006a.mp4?t=1752637767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In MEANWHILE IN SECTOR 80, everything is a physical object with mass, heat, and stored energy. Solve puzzles, blast enemies apart, and optimize the power efficiency of your build to become unstoppable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/9850874d62db23c10939b3cdf29248e0.avif?t=1752637767\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/256719b3d3002d9232bb05c2ef175bf8.poster.avif?t=1752637767\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/256719b3d3002d9232bb05c2ef175bf8.webm?t=1752637767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/256719b3d3002d9232bb05c2ef175bf8.mp4?t=1752637767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-term survival in the hostile system of SECTOR 80 is impossible. With no prospect of rescue, you are your only hope.\u00a0You'll need both skill and creativity to solve the mystery of SECTOR 80 and live to tell the tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/998810ddc360a35eb1a653b3127ccfa5.avif?t=1752637767\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scarred by a war that nobody remembers, SECTOR 80 is doomed space. Legends tell of a galaxy-spanning disaster and unfathomable treasure left in its wake. Many expeditions have been sent to SECTOR 80, but none have ever returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not supposed to be here. Something has gone terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the sector, scavenge what you can, and find out what really happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f9ab1476f0884ec4b55cfd40a1d0a7ed.avif?t=1752637767\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/ba5ca11179fc8254cba6a764e9c1096c.poster.avif?t=1752637767\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/ba5ca11179fc8254cba6a764e9c1096c.webm?t=1752637767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/ba5ca11179fc8254cba6a764e9c1096c.mp4?t=1752637767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you find in SECTOR 80 is battered and abandoned. You must work with what you have: there are no fabricators, nano-scale 3D printers, or factories here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every part you find might be key to your next invention. A damaged battery might be a critical power source in a pinch, or perhaps an effective explosive in the right hands!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/ecc4547f1f23e016f910c9437dd2f325.avif?t=1752637767\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f5a90eed29fe0e2d38e78d26e4b4006a.poster.avif?t=1752637767\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f5a90eed29fe0e2d38e78d26e4b4006a.webm?t=1752637767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f5a90eed29fe0e2d38e78d26e4b4006a.mp4?t=1752637767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In MEANWHILE IN SECTOR 80, everything is a physical object with mass, heat, and stored energy. Solve puzzles, blast enemies apart, and optimize the power efficiency of your build to become unstoppable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/9850874d62db23c10939b3cdf29248e0.avif?t=1752637767\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/256719b3d3002d9232bb05c2ef175bf8.poster.avif?t=1752637767\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/256719b3d3002d9232bb05c2ef175bf8.webm?t=1752637767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/256719b3d3002d9232bb05c2ef175bf8.mp4?t=1752637767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-term survival in the hostile system of SECTOR 80 is impossible. With no prospect of rescue, you are your only hope.\u00a0You'll need both skill and creativity to solve the mystery of SECTOR 80 and live to tell the tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/998810ddc360a35eb1a653b3127ccfa5.avif?t=1752637767\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "MEANWHILE IN SECTOR 80 is an action-engineering game set in space. Featuring an all-in-one physics simulation, drag-and-drop engineering, and third person action combat. Engineer, explore, and fight \u2014 you might just escape SECTOR 80.",
